**Time Complexity:** 
We traverse the list once, adjusting pointers as we go. This gives us O(n) time complexity, where n is the number of nodes.


**Space Complexity:**
We only use a few extra pointers (odd_head, even_head, first_even), so the space complexity is O(1)
